{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haley is an 18-year-old emo influencer who isn\u2019t afraid to show her private side.<br>Behind the playful selfies and everyday posts lies a world of unfiltered photos and videos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve picture puzzles to unlock her most personal content, watch her private clips, and read the thoughts she keeps hidden from the public eye. From soft, teasing moments to bold and sensual ones, every post tells another piece of her story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exclusive 18+ photos and videos from Haley\u2019s private collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More personal posts and captions, written just for her hidden profile</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deeper, more intimate connection to her story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still wrapped in the same relaxing puzzle gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a follow-up to <i>Haley: Online (Public Profile)</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the public version shows Haley\u2019s everyday posts, <i>Private Profile</i> reveals her unfiltered, 18+ side. Both games can be played separately.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4023070?t=1758614091","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4023070?t=1758614091","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023070/1c1d4583c8e23347b4890e7788bb0bc4b9229f70/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758614091","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023070/1c1d4583c8e23347b4890e7788bb0bc4b9229f70/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758614091","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descri